Modified / derived files (Apache-2.0 §4(b)):
  airpodsvr/protocol.py        from airpods_mouse_controller.py and gestures.py (protocol layer,
                               raw IMU parsing) — rewritten as a transport-independent module,
                               side-aware addressing, timestamp-window accel/gyro pairing,
                               SensorDataWX start packets and 58-byte motion block parsing.
  airpodsvr/transport/bluez.py from l2cap.py — simplified.
  tests/data/airpods3_raw_imu.json, tests/data/airpods3_motion.json
                               = MousePods captures/airpods3_glide_raw2.json and
                               captures/airpods3_motion_capture.json, unchanged,
                               CC BY 4.0, "MousePods by Matteo Gaudioso (starman-tech)".
All other files are new.

